counterfactuals.output:
A vehicle moving-object detection device comprising:

an imaging unit configured to capture an image of an area around a vehicle;

an image extraction unit configured to extract, from the image captured by the imaging unit, a plurality of detection images including a 1-1 image, a 1-2 image, a 2-1 image, and a 2-2 image, each corresponding to an entire region or a partial region of an upper body region or a lower body region of a moving object;

a feature calculation unit configured to calculate feature information from each of the 1-1 image, the 1-2 image, the 2-1 image, and the 2-2 image; and

a moving-object determination unit configured to determine whether the moving object is present in the captured image based on the feature information calculated from the plurality of detection images,

wherein the image extraction unit extracts the 1-1 image and the 1-2 image as images corresponding to the upper body region of the moving object, and extracts the 2-1 image and the 2-2 image as images corresponding to the lower body region of the moving object, at least one of the 1-1 image, the 1-2 image, the 2-1 image, and the 2-2 image corresponding to an entire body-region image and at least one other corresponding to a partial body-region image.
